{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/bundle_sheets.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:44:54.569545Z","id":"d1e411906deb0106cbc769ec68d319b5b44a20f0d37679e90d1151c2fdf27f16","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:f1c07f346b12","summary":"Fixed: the Include my data switch is gone; a modified copy offers Share Alex’s v2, Share mine and Share mine with my data, its subtitle naming the version it goes as ('Yours goes as v1'). Tests 'a modified copy: the original, or mine as a new app, with or without my data, its version shown' and 'shows what goes; Share sends no data, and nothing sits above the buttons to include it' in apps/clax_app/test/ui/bundle_sheets_test.dart pass (bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:ui_bundle_sheets_test //apps/clax_app:ui_bundle_flows_test //apps/clax_app:bundle_updater_test //apps/clax_app:ui_read_consent_dialog_test //apps/clax_app:platform_background_work_test //apps/clax_app:app_background_test //apps/clax_app:ui_change_sheet_test: all PASSED).","supersedes":"c1dc9d72cce22b4afc31ca857d047a0007a7aae307e7b2f57f703538d415c5e3","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/read_consent_dialog.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:44:54.662388Z","id":"aad45f1f3d4e4edeef5084d483759f30550cc04038588d0eaaf82c51c889166c","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:f1c07f346b12","summary":"Fixed: while the read consent waits, DialogReadConsent tells BackgroundRuns.needsOk its question, and the run's notification says 'Clax needs your OK' with it until the answer. Tests 'while Clax waits on the person, the notification says Clax needs your OK, then the run’s step again' (apps/clax_app/test/platform/background_work_test.dart) and the app_background_test consent test, which expects update(Clax needs your OK, Let Clax read Week?), pass (bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:ui_bundle_sheets_test //apps/clax_app:ui_bundle_flows_test //apps/clax_app:bundle_updater_test //apps/clax_app:ui_read_consent_dialog_test //apps/clax_app:platform_background_work_test //apps/clax_app:app_background_test //apps/clax_app:ui_change_sheet_test: all PASSED).","supersedes":"e2b8fca37b254e5b338cf987c8080dfe30d96084ea511421a6c068a82df882a0","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/theme.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:44:54.707437Z","id":"5064a7af4fab3c58c18e34c6a4813d9d4a8be478ec449b6517717232cddeecc4","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"4d447f4f4fc94032654cbd48e7e6a5523624fd1572361452fffb06c7240e79c9","summary":"change_sheet.dart's Open thread is now ClaxButton(kind: ClaxButtonKind.tonal), checked by 'Stop is destructive and Open thread tonal, both 40 high' in apps/clax_app/test/ui/change_sheet_test.dart (git:f1c07f346b12). Remaining site: build_plan.dart (grep -rn FilledButton.tonal apps/clax_app/lib).","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/working_chip.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:44:54.707681Z","id":"45fbe76af475e0440a328cd436803bdc1eb74a9853c9bd4786a9e6f9da238d67","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"7dd01921672ed730d4f9ca7ee53adf4a3e7bb1d0c6861dac3da03d06a17a545f","summary":"The change sheet half is fixed: its header line shows keepGoingIn(outcomeText, ClaxVerbs.of(context)), checked by 'a limit stop says Keep going in the pointer’s words' in apps/clax_app/test/ui/change_sheet_test.dart (git:f1c07f346b12). The Working chip (working_chip.dart) still shows outcomeText as stored.","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/make_service.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:46:26.947059Z","id":"6fb76ac799f1f7e7ed59c9ced1a81c17e011c36a5e292f4f1ed4efd02ba082dc","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:f1c07f346b12","summary":"Fixed: the making screen's failure shows failureDetail under Details only with Developer tools on; test 'a failure shows its raw text under Details only with Developer tools on' passes for both settings (bazelisk test //apps/clax_app:ui_making_screen_test)","supersedes":"10c2822441047d7eee9b610c5996c9eb6826c2eb3f74119af7dec3dc13b13a1b","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
