{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/ui/approval_sheet.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:22:28.474786Z","id":"16ea4b4d2f67f7937746ed0d3b573ce1b0ec62b2adac5dc43d8756c2cf5f262e","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:1eb330c6d","summary":"Fixed in 1eb330c6d. Test: apps/clax_app/test/ui/inbox_screen_test.dart 'names the author by a short form of their ID too, so two people named alike read apart, the widest grant included' (//apps/clax_app:ui_inbox_screen_test); seen in consent-approval shots (phone light, Mac dark). bazelisk test of the 30 touched //apps/clax_app test targets with //apps/clax_app:dart_analyze and //scripts:check_copy at b93c4d42f: 'Executed 25 out of 32 tests: 32 tests pass.' Mutation: with the handle forced to null it fails.","supersedes":"0bf8b717953eca13e2e402c957d06083bee7f8c7abad629c63d0f4e23353985a","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
